  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalation of trade controls, interdiction policies, insurance/financial restrictions and maritime inspection regimes directly prevents shipments being loaded or accepted by buyers, lowering actual export flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
