  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating trade controls, sanctions and blockades targeting maritime-linked counterparties increase compliance costs and counterparty risk, encouraging dealers and asset managers to reduce market-making inventories and withdraw from affected securities, degrading bond market liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_hostilities</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
