  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained overt strikes on fields, pipelines, refineries and power/maintenance infrastructure physically destroy wells, processing equipment and workforce access, directly reducing daily production capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
