  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in overt kinetic strikes create sudden uncertainty about regional stability, energy and trade flows, and insurance/liability outcomes, prompting rapid repricing and larger intraday moves in bond and related markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
</edge>
