  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Marked escalation in overt kinetic strikes raises threat perceptions and crisis signaling, prompting stronger strategic postures, military deployments and adversarial rhetoric that heighten US–China competition intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_competition</data>
</edge>
