  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A sharp uptick in kinetic strikes in Ukraine prompts the US and partners to surge naval assets (Eastern Mediterranean/Arabian Gulf) to protect logistics and deter escalation, which in turn provokes reciprocal Iranian naval deployments and more frequent US–Iran naval interactions, raising overall naval/military operational intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_hostilities</data>
</edge>
