  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter policy alignment among security partners enables coordinated enforcement actions (joint asset freezes, harmonized export controls and shared intelligence), raising the effective intensity of sanctions enforcement against the producing jurisdiction.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
