  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger, visible allied coordination on military and financial measures raises perceived tail‑risk of escalation and supply shocks, causing portfolio reallocations toward net long positions in core sovereign bonds and flight‑to‑quality hedges.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
