  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Broader and deeper restrictive measures cause banks, insurers and energy investors to withdraw or suspend financing and insurance for upstream projects, halting new capital commitments and contract closures.</data>
