  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Broad or secondary sanctions on banks, clearinghouses or commodity flows disrupt cross‑border repo, collateral mobility and dealer balance‑sheet access, producing immediate deterioration in fixed‑income market depth and execution capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
