  <data key="d37">Escalating sanctions that constrain energy exports and financial channels push up near‑term headline inflation and risk premia, leading markets to price a higher path for short‑term policy rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
