  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Expanded and coordinated sanctions and export controls related to the conflict create interagency processes, legal precedents and partner coordination that are repurposed to strengthen and enforce export controls and AI‑related regulatory frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
