  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter cross-border technology and investment regulations (export controls, blocking rules, compliance requirements) fragment trading relationships and increase settlement/friction costs, directly reducing depth and willingness to trade large bond blocks in global markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_competition</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
