  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger, more coherent regulatory and export‑control regimes allow governments to design and enforce broader targeted and secondary sanctions (including tech controls) against actors supporting the war, raising the intensity and scope of sanctions pressure on Russia.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_competition</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
