  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher long-term government yields raise sovereign borrowing costs and near‑term fiscal pressure in donor countries, slowing approvals and disbursements for large weapons purchases and aid packages destined for the theatre.</data>
