  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Expansion of upstream production capacity (new fields/infrastructure) raises the strategic value of nearby sea lines and terminals, prompting the producing state to fortify maritime defenses and the US to increase presence and readiness to protect commercial access, increasing naval operational intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
