  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in crude export flows eases near-term global oil supply, lowering headline inflation and inflation risk premia and thereby reducing long-duration nominal government yields.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_turmoil</data>
</edge>
