  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising crude export flows from non‑Russian suppliers lower import prices and fiscal/market pressure on buyers, freeing budgetary resources and political capital that governments can divert to increase deliveries of arms and military aid into the Ukraine theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_supply_reordering</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
